# ============================================================
# RAVAGE ERA — PIN VAULT  (pin.env)
# ============================================================
# Edit this file ANYTIME to change the PINs, then re-upload it
# to GitHub. The site reads this file live on every page load.
#
# Format:  SECTION=PIN     (one PIN per line)
# Sections: SENSI | SPIN | LIKES
# 10 PINs per section. Add or remove lines freely.
#
# Every PIN is ONE-TIME USE: after a visitor uses it once, it
# expires (tracked in that visitor's browser via localStorage).
#
# NOTE: pin.env must stay next to index.html in the same folder.

